---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import FeatureList from './FeatureList.astro';
import { featuresIn, sections } from '../content/features';
const s = sections.find((x) => x.id === 'how')!;
---

<Section id={s.id} title={s.title} lede={s.lede}>
  <div class="split">
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <h3>The operator opens a round</h3>
        <p>One service, one society, a deadline, and a price ladder negotiated with a vendor: ₹1,000 alone, ₹800 at 5 ACs, ₹700 at 10.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <h3>You pledge what you need</h3>
        <p>Two ACs, three rooms, one 25 kg pack. One tap, and an SMS confirms it. Change or leave any time before the deadline.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <h3>Neighbours join, the price drops</h3>
        <p>Every pledge moves the ladder for everyone. Share the round to the society group with one tap; the people you bring in lower your own price.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <h3>The deadline closes it, a person books it</h3>
        <p>At the deadline the round closes on its own. The operator assigns the vendor at the unlocked price, the job gets done, and you rate it.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <FeatureList items={featuresIn('how')} />
  </div>
</Section>
